re.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/extras/second.gif?t=1745348424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Byte of the Dead features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base construction and upgrades.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/extras/thrid.gif?t=1745348424\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/extras/fourth.gif?t=1745348424\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlocking more powerful weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/extras/sixth.gif?t=1745348424\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day and night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voiced missions and a story to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An escape vehicle to assemble and use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/extras/fifth.gif?t=1745348424\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bulit in Godot 4.4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visuals effects like, SDFGI global illumination light, FSR 2.2, volumetric fog, day and night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">large open world to explore</p></li></ul>","developers":["Root Code Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643480/9ba98d942f55a4d663b18e554a88c23356add86b/header.jpg?t=1745348424","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127610,"mp4":{"480":"http:/